    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20393" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">helvĕnācus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		helvus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>pale yellow</i>, <i>yellowish</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitis,</span>”
				<i>a particular kind of wine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 2, 4, § 32</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus palmitum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 5, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					23, 1, 24, § 47</span></i>
			.—Also: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">helvĕnācĭus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 2, 55</span></i>
			.</div>
